  "observed_findings": [
    "The native Shell fixture is admitted with notificationListener active and both readNotifications and notificationActions present. Admission observes three native rows; only the uniquely tagged Shell fixture is serialized in device_notification_fixture.",
    "Action Center is fully visible at 360 by 574 points. The unique fixture title and body have fully-visible measured bounds and appear in the original screenshot, wrapped within the notification content width.",
    "The first Action Center screenshot shows the Shell group and a following System UI group. It does not expose every lower group or prove complete cross-store chronological ordering.",
    "After listener revocation, the same mounted process reports zero native rows, no fixture records, no fixture labels and no native notification operations. Action Center remains open; the original revoked screenshot shows preserved local Messaging and Outlook groups.",
    "After the driver Back action, a fresh Start observation has Action Center closed and the unread Messaging tile badge still equals 1.",
    "The Start unread screenshot shows badge 1, and the later Messaging screenshot renders the unique received SMS fixture. Their observations retain the same fixture nonce and process id."
  ],
